WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.120
Detection engineering transforms threat knowledge and operational experience into

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.018
meaningful signals that support defenders.

00:00:06.018 --> 00:00:10.070
Effective detections depend on quality telemetry, thoughtful prioritization,

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:13.215
operational collaboration, lifecycle maintenance, and continuous improvement.

00:00:13.215 --> 00:00:16.070
Success is not measured by the number of alerts generated,

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.940
but by helping security teams identify, investigate,

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.000
and respond to suspicious activity efficiently and effectively.
